
📊 Task 1: E-Commerce Sales Analysis (Power BI)

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing e-commerce sales data to understand business performance and identify key revenue drivers. Using Power BI, raw transactional data was cleaned, modeled, and visualized to highlight best-selling products, high-revenue categories, and overall sales trends.
The objective of this task is to convert large volumes of sales data into clear, actionable insights that can support business decision-making.

🛠 Tools & Technologies

Power BI
Power Query
DAX
CSV / Excel Dataset (Sample Superstore)

📊 Dashboard Features

KPI Cards
Total Sales
Total Profit
Total Quantity Sold
Sales Trend Analysis
Line chart showing sales performance over time
Category-wise Sales Analysis
Comparison of revenue generated by each product category
Top 10 Best-Selling Products
Identification of products contributing the highest sales
Segment / Region-wise Analysis
Understanding which customer segments or regions drive revenue
Interactive Slicers
Filters for category, region, and time period

🔍 Key Insights

Technology is the highest revenue-generating product category.
A small number of products contribute a significant portion of total sales.
The Consumer segment dominates overall sales performance.
Sales show a consistent upward trend, indicating business growth.
Regional sales performance varies, suggesting scope for targeted strategies.

🎯 Outcome

The dashboard provides a comprehensive view of sales performance and enables stakeholders to quickly identify growth opportunities, optimize product strategy, and make data-driven business decisions.
